# Masks every message about to be forwarded - see actions.py for why the
# built-in masking rail is not enough.
#
# The action rewrites the outgoing message list in place and returns the
# masked LAST user turn. That return value has to be written back to
# $user_message: in passthrough mode NeMo re-inserts $user_message as the last
# user turn after the rails run, so leaving it alone would put the original,
# unmasked text back on top of the masked copy.
define subflow mask all messages
  $masked = execute mask_all_messages
  if $masked
    $user_message = $masked

# NeMo 0.24.1 bug: once the tool_input rails finish, nothing emits the
# UserMessage event that the rest of the pipeline waits on, so a request ending
# in a tool result is never sent to the model and the caller gets an empty
# reply. Emit it ourselves. Fixed upstream after 0.24.1
# (NVIDIA-NeMo/Guardrails#2188) - remove this flow on that bump rather than
# emit the event a second time.
define flow resume generation after tool input rails
  event ToolInputRailsFinished
  create event UserMessage(text=$user_message)
